sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Application
  participant F as MacFactory
  participant B as MacButton
  participant C as MacCheckbox
  App->>F: createButton()
  F->>B: new MacButton()
  F-->>App: Button
  App->>F: createCheckbox()
  F->>C: new MacCheckbox()
  F-->>App: Checkbox
  Note over App,C: A aplicação só conhece as interfaces.<br/>Todos os widgets são da mesma família (macOS).
  App->>B: render()
  App->>C: render()
